 <h3><u>Bazaar Agaya He</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p><b><u><font size=4></font></u></b></p>
  <p><b><u><font size=4>Bazaar Agaya He </font></u></b></p>
  <b><u><font size=4> </font></u></b>
  <p><font size=4>Noke sina pe farqe burida salam le<br> Ay Fatima ke qalbe darida salam le<br> Kya tera faisla he <br> Behan kya kare bata</font></p>
  <font size=4> <p><br> (Bazaar agaya he, Behan kya kare bata) x2</p> 
   <ol>
    <li>Athara bhaiyon ki behan aur berida<br> Dekho khare hein kitne tamashaai ja baja<br> Dil roke puchhta he, Behan kya kare bata</li>
    <p>(Bazaar agaya he, Behan kya kare bata) x2</p>
    <li>Khutbon ki tegh saath he aur sabr dhaal he<br> Zakhmon se chur chur badan dil nidhal he<br> Ye meri karbala he, Behan kya kare bata </li>
    <p>(Bazaar agaya he, Behan kya kare bata) x2</p>
    <li>Naaqon pe ehle bayt bhi gham ke safeer hein<br> Pathhar he taziyane hein neze hein teer hein<br> Zakhmon ki ye dawa he, Behan kya kare bata</li>
    <p>(Bazaar agaya he, Behan kya kare bata) x2</p>
    <li>Na paak in zabaanon pe ab naam he mera<br> He qafele ka karwan ghairat ka ik khuda<br> Ye gham bohot bara he, Behan kya kare bata</li>
    <p>(Bazaar agaya he, Behan kya kare bata) x2</p>
    <li>Aankho(n) se kyu na ho meri seylaab-e-gham rawaa(n)</li>
    <p>Qaydi rasool-e-zaadiyaa(n), Sajjad saarebaa(n)</p>
    <p>Sadmo(n) ki inteha hai, behan kya kare bata</p>
    <p>(Bazaar agaya he, Behan kya kare bata) x2</p>
    <li>Jana he sar khule mujhe darbaar kuchh bata<br> Ey karwane dard ke salar kuchh bata<br> Tu zabt ka khuda he, Behan kya kare bata</li>
    <p>(Bazaar agaya he, Behan kya kare bata) x2</p>
    <li>Nake se girgayi he sakina mere hussain<br> Kya jaane ab kahan he hazina mere hussain<br> Anjaan rasta he, Behan kya kare bata</li>
    <p>(Bazaar agaya he, Behan kya kare bata) x2</p>
    <li>Darbaar aaraha he behan kya kare bata<br> Kulsum ham nawa he behan kya kare bata<br> Har zakhm puchhta he, Behan kya kare bata</li>
    <p>(Bazaar agaya he, Behan kya kare bata) x2</p>
    <li>Irfan dard he tujhe aur gham se agahi<br> Likhti kitabe ranjo alam mazhar abdi<br> Aur naam ye rakha he, Behan kya kare bata </li>
   </ol> <p>(Bazaar agaya he, Behan kya kare bata) x3</p></font>
